  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a wok or large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add ground beef and cook until browned, breaking it into small pieces as it cooks.",
    "Add onions, bell peppers, carrots, celery, and garlic to the pan. Stir-fry for about 5 minutes.",
    "Pour in vegetable broth, soy sauce, and cream cheese. Simmer gently for 10 minutes or until thickened.",
    "Serve hot with steamed rice if desired.",
